  "transcript_asr": "What happens during a major corporate merger? Oh, wow. When two massive global companies combine, is the future of M &A less about merging finances and entirely about whether their respective AI ontologies can successfully negotiate a shared reality? If company A's ontology defines risk or revenue in a way that fundamentally clashes with company B's ontology at a mathematical level, can the merger ever truly succeed without completely rewriting the central nervous system of one of the companies?",
